      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——随后到了周一。\n学园的训练员们收到了\n前些天进行的健康检查的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bc0417a2629816dbfe60516f3c65cc77ac19a583e80fb415a73a459527487f6",
