    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d85cb97eade10ab23287771",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "忙碌的每一天。\n早已隐约感觉到\n积攒了慢性的疲劳……。",
